      "content": "i honestly dont even know how to face tomorrow. everything i spent ten years building just... vanished overnight. the bankruptcy filings, the calls from the bank. i feel like i'm just freefalling. there's no way to land this without everyone seeing me as this complete joke. the shame of it is actually worse than the money part.",
